{"ID":"20230925154409-8wbrxm9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154409-8wbrxm9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154409-8wbrxm9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154423-946oay9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154423-fhbkblz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154423-fhbkblz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:36,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:36\u0026#125;","title":"【三黄汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154423-946oay9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154423-946oay9","updated":"20230925154423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：麻黄五分、独活四分、细辛二分、黄芪二分、黄芩三分；"}]},{"ID":"20230925154423-vwpva7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154423-vwpva7p","updated":"20230925154423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上五味，以水六升，煮取二升，分温三服，一服小汗，二服大汗。心热加大黄二分，腹满加枳实一枚，气逆加人参三分，悸加牡蛎三分，渴加栝蒌根三分，先有寒加附子一枚。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154423-fhbkblz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154423-fhbkblz","updated":"20230925154423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《千金三黄汤》：治中风手足拘急，百节疼痛，烦热心乱，恶寒，经日不欲饮食。"}]}]}